These targets use ordinary format-5 inputs and declared native sources, parser,
crunchide transforms, archives and startup objects.
They do not represent the complete rescue selection.
They do not install host rescue files.
.Pp
The bounded rescue core also includes hostname, ln, mkdir, realpath, rmdir and
