Its archive remains internal and does not create an installed userland library.
The native test runner rejects different configured files sharing one runfiles
path; callers must declare distinct artifact names for such test inputs.
The ELF object inspector compares allocated bytes and symbolic relocations
without rewriting objects or normalizing diagnostic strings.
Debug and live firmware execution require separate qualification.
.Ss IA32 standalone library qualification
The regular libsa32 and private EFI libsa32efi components share the maintained
