The loader_biosdisk_debug and loader_bios_framebuffer boolean settings retain
Make defaults false and apply only to the corresponding compiler contexts.
Format-5 build-settings can override these values through the maintained frontend.
The archive remains internal and adds no installed library.
Host inspection and compiler comparisons do not execute BIOS services.
.Ss BTX startup construction
The BIOS BTX startup object uses the i386 standalone toolchain and an explicit
ordered relocatable link, rather than a hosted executable target with manual
