Shared boot-data rules retain image/manual package policy and archive metadata.
The maintained Make reference helper accepts component and BOOT_component
presence-only namespaces with its existing assignment/global-identity guards.
Original-reference comparisons retain the SDK loader prerequisite and distinguish
