hardlinks. Each contribution installs its own image; only simple installs the
original generated loader.help.bios file.
The loader_pxe_interpreter setting defaults to auto and inherits this choice;
explicit values independently select the corresponding real client.
Host tests reconcile default aliases, help and archive inodes with actual Make
stages. They do not execute firmware or qualify a complete installed system.

