.Ss Reproducible Ficl generation
The maintained Make softcore generator omits the host date when
WITH_REPRODUCIBLE_BUILD is selected through the existing src-conf input.
Ordinary developer builds retain their previous date comment.
Fresh original generation then matches the native undated source exactly,
including diagnostic line/file directives. No compiler output is patched.

