The independent Make consumer object, file/directory metadata and manual bytes
match; both debug CRCs verify. With an explicit source-root compiler macro-prefix
policy, the original controlled library/link matches native allocated sections,
entry and program headers. Ordinary raw Make/debug byte equality is not claimed.
Safe missing-login behavior executes without opening a vacation database or
sending a reply. Real mail/database scenarios and full-system gates remain open.
The generic frontend dispatcher, signing and publication policy are unchanged.

.Ss Optional Telnet consumer and shared baud correction
The existing format-5 telnet setting selects native AMD64 Telnet with original
