qualify that correction. No build-only source definition is injected.
Nineteen consumer contexts and eleven internal-library contexts match original
contracts, including two declared filename-policy controls; original install
metadata, manuals, debug CRCs and direct library order agree. Whole image/debug
byte equality and live service authentication/negotiation remain unqualified.
The combined converted-optionals production profile passes with 273 archives,
five cached tests, unchanged prior outputs and no file/directory path conflicts.
This does not complete world/pkgbase, cross-platform or resource qualification.
No C dispatcher, signing, publication or host installation policy changes occur.

Configured checks separately preserve rejection of the direct Telnet Heimdal
path, root Heimdal profile and incomplete full installed-tests parent.
These are configuration checks, not runtime qualification of rejected paths.

.Ss Native library and program composition
The existing format-5 workflow builds the selected program-family archives,
library and administration parents, dtraced and switchboardctl natively.
Private CTF/SPL implementation includes do not become public client includes.
SPL declares its pthread provider in both native rules and the maintained Make
