Certificate inventory follows the source trusted and untrusted directories;
ordinary builds do not fetch certificates or alter the host trust store.
OpenSSL, OpenSSH, USB security-key helper and CA-root selections follow their
explicit settings.
The unfinished complete installed-test hierarchy and other ABIs remain gated;
selected cryptographic and in-memory TLS tests do not establish SSH login or
whole-system authentication acceptance.

.Pp
Native qualification expands requested test suites through configured Bazel
queries and records a normal build of the compatible test executables with the
