The native production share parent follows the maintained shared-data traversal,
including dictionary and shared-documentation settings.
Its normal installation endpoint rejects tests-enabled requests until installed
share, example and timezone test hierarchies are converted.
Termcap manual installation follows manual enablement and compression while
