The complete native include parent composes ordinary and generated headers,
kernel ABI groups, architecture companions and installed compatibility aliases.
Kernel source globs and explicit groups are owned by existing source packages.
The normal includes selection gates the kernel copy phase and its directories;
companion child beforeinstall directories and the library include alias retain
