The nine selected test targets may reuse qualified Bazel cache results.
This does not qualify the complete installed test hierarchy, independent
whole-world payload parity or all pkgbase/hardware publication and runtime gates.
The existing explicit-input interface supports this composition; Make remains
the production default.

